<title>UK: POLAR AIR NAMES BUTLER AS JKF TERMINAL SERVICES.</title>
<headline>POLAR AIR NAMES BUTLER AS JKF TERMINAL SERVICES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polar Air Cargo said Robert B.Butler has been appointed as director of terminal services at JFK International airport, where he will be responsible for day-to-day operations. In a statement, Ian Jackson, the vice-president of the Long Beach-based carrier's terminal operations said &quot; JFK is one of Polar's largest international import and export centres..... it is critical to our global expansion.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
<p>- www.racs.com</p>
